From: Midgy BALON <midgy971@gmail.com>
Subject: [WIP - provisional, NOT upstream] drm/sun4i: A523 raw panel-lighting diff

This is the COMPLETE RAW diff of the DRM display drivers from the on-hardware
working tree (v7.2-rc3 base) that actually lights the Trimui Smart Pro S panel.
It is provided for REPRODUCIBILITY while the clean, split, upstream-shaped
patches are still being extracted -- it is deliberately NOT upstream-clean
(it contains debug prints and experiments).

HOW TO USE: apply to a pristine v7.2-rc3 kernel from its root:
    git apply drm-display-provisional.patch
It is self-contained for the DRM side -- it creates sun55i_de.{c,h},
sun55i_de_scaler.h and panel-trimui-smart-pro-s.c, and modifies
sun4i_tcon / sun6i_mipi_dsi / sun8i_mixer / sun8i_tcon_top / sun4i_crtc, etc.
Combine with the board DT (dts/) + the PWM0 patches (0005/0006) for a full build.

RELATION TO THE CLEAN PIECES: this is the RAW, UNSPLIT source. It is a superset
of -- and overlaps -- the already-split-out clean pieces (patches 0001/0004/0007/
0008, kernel/harvest-sun55i-de/sun55i_de.*, dts/*.dtsi, the drop-in panel driver).
For the DRM display, apply EITHER the clean pieces OR this raw patch, NOT both.

WHAT IT CONTAINS (the panel-lighting fixes, still provisional):
 - RCQ (Register Config Queue) arm-at-target for the DE-v35x/DE33 mixer latch
   (sun8i_mixer.c + the harvested sun55i_de.c);
 - the TCON CPU-interface (8080) per-frame trigger + a523_stock_trigger timing +
   set_displl() DISPLL/LCD clock setup (sun4i_tcon.c);
 - the DSI1 clock-gate (bit 17) + A523 tcon-top compatible (sun8i_tcon_top.c);
 - the 62 MHz TCON/DSI/DISPLL clocking (thermal/uniformity) and the
   continuous-TCON vblank rework (sun4i_crtc.c).

OPEN (not yet solved): YUV<->RGB colour conversion in the DE/DSI output path, and
hardening the CPU-interface DSI per-frame retrigger for reliable continuous
refresh. Cleanup into upstream-acceptable patches is tracked in
docs/DISPLAY-PORT-STATUS.md. HW-verified on a Trimui Smart Pro S (A523).

Assisted-by: Claude (Opus 4.8)
Signed-off-by: Midgy BALON <midgy971@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Kconfig b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Kconfig
index 7450b2762..e4c49aa71 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Kconfig
@@ -1345,4 +1345,13 @@ config DRM_PANEL_XINPENG_XPP055C272
 	  Say Y here if you want to enable support for the Xinpeng
 	  XPP055C272 controller for 720x1280 LCD panels with MIPI/RGB/SPI
 	  system interfaces.
+config DRM_PANEL_TRIMUI_SMART_PRO_S
+	tristate "Trimui Smart Pro S MIPI-DSI panel"
+	depends on OF
+	depends on DRM_MIPI_DSI
+	depends on BACKLIGHT_CLASS_DEVICE
+	help
+	  Say Y here to support the MIPI-DSI panel on the Trimui Smart Pro S
+	  handheld (720x1280, 4-lane RGB888, Ilitek/Fitipower-class DDIC).
+
 endmenu
